summary:
  start-mpris.sh starts the bridge without the flag it was given.

history:
  The widget asks for moments on the launcher's command line, and the
  launcher has to hand that on to mpris.py, or the bridge counts 1, 2, 3 for
  a widget that reads the number as a clock.

target:
  package/contents/ui/start-mpris.sh

find:
  [[ "${3:-}" == --ms-seq ]] && SEQ_FLAG=(--ms-seq)

replace:
  [[ "${3:-}" == --ms-seq ]] && SEQ_FLAG=()

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_mpris_seq.py::test_the_launcher_hands_the_flag_on.
  Line-neutral.
